OL,3,GNEWSAFears grow for future of Battle of
OL,4,ABritain memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of the Battle of Britain
OL,7,FMemorial has been cast into doubt as
OL,8,Ftrustees warn rising costs are forcing
OL,9,Fthem to dig into reserves to keep the
OL,10,Fsite running.
OL,12,FThe national memorial at
OL,13,FCapel-le-Ferne, in Kent, which honours
OL,14,Faircrew who fought in the Battle of
OL,15,FBritain, receives no direct government
OL,16,Ffunding.
OL,18,FWing Cdr Ian Woodhouse, honorary
OL,19,Fsecretary of the memorial, said
OL,20,Fobtaining adequate funding was becoming
OL,21,Fan "increasing concern" despite the
OL,22,Fsite's national significance.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
