OL,3,GNEWSAFears grow for future of Battle of
OL,4,ABritain memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence said it does
OL,7,Fnot routinely fund museums or memorials
OL,8,Fbut they can apply for grants through
OL,9,Fthe National Lottery and Heritage
OL,10,FFunds, adding fundraising help is
OL,11,Favailable at the War Memorials Trust.
